  "notes": "{頷|うなず}く specifically refers to the head-nodding motion that indicates agreement or acknowledgment.\n\nWRITING:\nOften written in hiragana as うなずく or with okurigana as {頷|うなず}く.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{首|くび}→首：00792_kubi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{縦|たて}→縦：17236_tate⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{振|ふ}る→振る：01983_furu⟧: to nod (literally \"shake head vertically\")\n- ⟦{首|くび}→首：00792_kubi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{横|よこ}→横：02984_yoko⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{振|ふ}る→振る：01983_furu⟧: to shake head (to indicate \"no\")",
